          %h3#in_physics In physics
          %p
            The name arises due to the requirement that the structure group of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+bundle"} tangent bundle
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spacetime"} spacetime
            lifts to
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Spin
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi n
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Spin(n)
            so as to ‘define particles with spin’… (Someone more awake and focused please put this into proper words!)
